### 5. How to integrate (full instructions)

1. Replace original `Common.hlsl` with the new one.  
2. Add `ThirdPersonCamera` and `PlayerController` classes into your DX3D / Game project.  
3. In your `MainGame::onCreate()`:
   - Create player at (0,0,5)
   - Initialize camera with distance 7.5, height 2.2
4. In `MainGame::onUpdate(float dt)`:
   - Read mouse delta → camera.SetMouseDelta
   - player.Update(dt, input)
   - camera.Update(dt, player.GetPosition(), player.GetYaw())
   - Set view matrix from camera
5. Bind the new material properties (metallic, roughness, emissive) in your material PSMain functions.

